# Mauvely OS: minimise, maximise and close on the right, nothing on the left.
# The Mauvely global themes carry this in their layoutdefaults too, but Plasma
# applies a theme's title-bar layout only with its desktop layout, and a new
# account that switches light and dark by time of day gets appearance alone.

[org.kde.kdecoration2]
ButtonsOnLeft=
ButtonsOnRight=IAX
